  "rationale": "Setting --skip_qc true empties the QC tool list and skips the whole BAM_QC_RNASEQ block, both DESeq2 QC steps, and both FastQC runs, since skip_fastqc is passed as skip_fastqc || skip_qc. Alignment, quantification, markduplicates, bigWig and StringTie are not gated by skip_qc, so they run as before. MultiQC still runs but receives a different set of files, and its strandedness section now comes from the Salmon inference instead of RSeQC, so it must be re-executed."
